OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry with patchy cloud
OL,6,Farriving but still sunny spells.
OL,7,FStaying very cold with temperatures
OL,8,Fstruggling to rise much about
OL,9,Ffreezing, and feeling a lot colder in
OL,10,Fthe brisk winds. Later a few wintry
OL,11,Fshowers may arrive along the coast.
OL,12,FMaximum Temperature 3C.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FMainly dry and clear with a
OL,15,Fwidespread hard frost. However, there
OL,16,Fis a chance that patchy cloud and a
OL,17,Ffew wintry showers will reach the
OL,18,FLincolnshire coast later tonight.
OL,19,FMinimum Temperature -4C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
