OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FFrequent heavy snow showers
OL,6,Fwill develop along the Lincolnshire
OL,7,Fcoast, perhaps bringing travel
OL,8,Fdisruption. Dry and brighter
OL,9,Felsewhere. Windy along the coast and
OL,10,Fbreezy inland, and feeling bitterly
OL,11,Fcold everywhere. Maximum Temperature
OL,12,F2C.
OL,13,
OL,14,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMostly
OL,15,Fdry and sunny or clear, and widespread
OL,16,Fsharp overnight frosts with an
OL,17,Fincreasing chance of patchy freezing
OL,18,Ffog. Coastal wintry showers Sunday,
OL,19,Fprobably easing later Monday. Cold.
OL,20,FOften breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
